## Proposed Changes

### File 1: `useAttendanceHeartbeat.ts` — Add guard to skip all recorded providers

#### [MODIFY] [`useAttendanceHeartbeat.ts`](file:///c:/Users/ASUS/OneDrive/Pictures/NERMAI_NEW/web_portal/lms/hooks/useAttendanceHeartbeat.ts)

**Lines 4–6** — Expand the provider type to make `isRecorded` detection possible:

```diff
